        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion B-EL-B9, Traditional Oval Rope Doorbell Button</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nElegant in both shape and style, this doorbell made by Fusion is crafted out of solid brass. It features a rope around its circumference. The old world styling of this doorbell is only accentuated by all 3 of the beautiful finishes. Oval Rope Rose Doorbell Button features a lighted doorbell actuator.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Please Note</b> This is a replacement trim only. It comes packaged with lighted button, rosette, and installation screws. It DOES NOT include the chime.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Classic Rope Doorbell Fusion B9:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Includes lighted button.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged as a kit with matching finish installation screws and a lighted button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
